  "bio": "Discover the enigmatic artistry of Lost and Found Tattoo Studio nestled in Cranford, NJ, where the stroke of fineline elegance, the essence of illustrative storytelling, and the timeless shade of black & gray coalesce. Each piece crafted within is a testament to precision and creativity, echoed by the studio's cohort of visionary artists, including the renowned @fast_ali. Here, skinscapes are transformed into personal narratives, etched with expertise and care.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cranford, New Jersey, United States"
